commit 999203bdead15ca74302665832b7fb752862e37d
Author: Seul Lee <ftk3187@athena.athena.research.northwestern.edu>
Date:   Mon Oct 19 22:14:47 2026 -0500

    P136 step 2: ontology + form
    
    2a feature_width/feature_depth/feature_extent: lateral-channel aliases (channel height,
       H (channel height); channel length, L (channel length); channel width, W (channel
       width)) and a note on each. "gap height" left out: the held-out gre23 gold files
       other[gap height], and check.py P78 would then ask to re-key held-out gold.
    2b units.yaml same_dimension {length_per_cycle: length}; export.unit_tables computes
       both on one base; lists.convert compares through DIMENSION_OF.
    2c form: term (required on definitions); variables on definition and model, values a
       quantity id or null; value_text enum by quantity (material/substrate -> material,
       reactant_A/B -> species, structure -> the ontology's structure ids); kind required
       with any value field; quote without the 15-word cap; description paths kb/pilot/.
    compile.py: a null variable is not an unresolved id.
    Ontology hash 23c7643e (was 6f0cea60); vocab.py +9/-4; export.py --check and
    check.py on the gold pass.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

